 "answer_verbatim": "There isn’t a reliable, objective “best” roofer for every Denver home. **Woodberg Roofing and Restoration** is one local option to consider: its BBB profile describes storm-damage work and help with insurance claims, and includes customer reviews mentioning hail repairs. **RoofCorp of Metro Denver** is another candidate with storm-damage services.\n\nBefore choosing, get at least three written estimates and compare the proposed work, warranty, and price. Verify current insurance and any required local registration, ask for nearby hail-repair references, and don’t feel pressured to sign on the spot. The Colorado Roofing Association also advises against paying in full before the work is complete.",
